# Supabase Project Credentials
# Create a new free project at https://supabase.com
# Run the SQL script from `supabase/schema.sql` in the Supabase SQL Editor
# Then paste your project credentials below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-publishable-key-here
